      "text": "Categorification of sl_2 and braid groups — 20 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Self-equivalences\n\n**Categorification of sl_2 and braid groups**\n\n*RAPHAËL ROUQUIER*\n\n22 pp, 20 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Self-equivalences; 2.1 A general construction; 2.2 Applications; 3 The 2-braid group; 3.1 Coxeter group action; 3.2 Braid group action; 3.3 Rigidification; 4 Principal block of a semi-simple complex Lie; 4.1 Review of category O; 4.2 Link with bimodules; 5 Flag varieties; 5.1 Classical results; 5.3 Link with bimodules; 5.2 Genuine braid group action; 6.1 Classical isomorphisms; 6 Appendix : associativity of kernel transform",
